# Design-system boundary (frontend)

Presentation-only primitives in **`components/design-system/`** — no IPTV/config/auth domain in names or logic.

## Layering

| Layer | Path | Role |
| ----- | ---- | ---- |
| **Design system** | `components/design-system/` | Buttons, fields, shells, visual **tone** badges |
| **Theme** | `theme/tokens.ts`, `createAppTheme.ts` | Slate palette, motion, breakpoints, **`AccentTone`** |
| **Brand** | `theme/brand.ts` | Product-only (donate) — not imported from design-system |
| **Core** | `components/core/` | Business kind → DS props (`SourceTypeBadge`, `DonateButton`) |
| **Containers** | `containers/` | Screens, Redux, API |

## Naming

- DS: **`ToneBadge`**, **`FieldText`**, **`DialogShell`** — visual names only.
- No product terms in DS: `SourceType`, `Xtream`, `Prefetch`, `Donate`, `Config`, etc.
- Pass generic props (`tone`, `appearance`) from **core** / **containers**.

## Imports (design-system)

- **Allowed:** `@/utils/styled`, `@/theme/tokens`, `@mui/*`, `react`.
- **Avoid:** `@/store`, `@/containers`, `@/infra/api`, `@/theme/brand`, product i18n.

## New primitives

1. API makes sense without IPTV context (**YAGNI** — add only when a caller exists today; **`design-principles.mdc`**).
2. Product-specific UI → **core** wrapper.
3. Export domain-neutral symbols from **`components/design-system/index.ts`**.

